#: ../../source/index.rst:77 0a65c95e87ea4b258f8e21b84afc1607
msgid "System components"
msgstr "系统组成"

#: ../../source/index.rst:80 43176d5c72c44f82be3f23cc0f077ec4
msgid ""
"A Pixhawk or :ref:`other autopilot <common-autopilots>` loaded with the "
"latest version of the `Copter firmware <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"一块 Pixhawk 或 :ref:`其他飞控 <common-autopilots>`，并刷入最新版的 `Copter 固件 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:83 53184168ed4a48cb9d5dcb8c7e91c345
msgid ""
":ref:`Mission Planner software <planner:home>` -- gives you an easy point-"
"and-click setup/configuration, and a full-featured ground control interface."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Mission Planner 软件 <planner:home>` —— 提供易于使用的点选式安装与配置，以及功能完整的地面站界面。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:86 e2951fe35fdb47c38bbe27105bcb0e99
msgid ""
"This Copter Wiki provides all the information you need to set up and operate"
" a multicopter or traditional helicopter."
msgstr "本 Copter Wiki 提供安装与操作多旋翼或传统直升机所需的全部信息。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:88 a947535e33c64aecae9c0dd9be6cd2c4
msgid ""
"A suitable :ref:`MultiCopter <build-your-own-multicopter>` or "
":ref:`Helicopter <traditional-helicopters>` for your mission."
msgstr ""
"一台适合你任务的 :ref:`多旋翼 <build-your-own-multicopter>` 或 :ref:`直升机 <traditional-"
"helicopters>`。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:91 352c22599edf4569b15cc5540824a9be
msgid ""
"Plus many other useful options: e.g. data radios, which allow two-way "
"wireless telemetry and control between the vehicle and your computer."
msgstr "另外还有许多有用的可选组件，例如数传电台，可在载具与电脑之间提供双向无线遥测与控制。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:97 eb04b265353b4b9dbcb77053b09ddedb
msgid "Rotor Craft types"
msgstr "旋翼机类型"

#: ../../source/index.rst:127 3bd03164fccc4eeaa373f4b6cbee9042
msgid ":ref:`Multicopters <what-is-a-multicopter-and-how-does-it-work>`:"
msgstr ":ref:`多旋翼 <what-is-a-multicopter-and-how-does-it-work>`："

#: ../../source/index.rst:129 688f926fbe7e40aa842e893f4c1c6f47
msgid ""
"Utilize differential thrust management of independent motor-prop units to "
"provide lift and directional control"
msgstr "通过独立电机—螺旋桨单元的差动推力管理来提供升力与方向控制"

#: ../../source/index.rst:131 1e4ccbf8ee7145e09c3e93e7b049e9d1
msgid "Benefit from mechanical simplicity and design flexibility"
msgstr "结构简单、设计灵活"

#: ../../source/index.rst:132 d974f2d85f1a4506aadbda4eaf6380a1
msgid "A capable payload lifter that's functional in strong wind conditions"
msgstr "强风条件下仍可正常工作的载荷搬运平台"

#: ../../source/index.rst:133 39ce9434afe5441cac00ec45c18bd4dc
msgid "Redundant lift sources can give increased margin of safety"
msgstr "多升力源带来的冗余可提升安全裕度"

#: ../../source/index.rst:134 63fb4640242a4988a53ee71bc735a469
msgid "Varied form factor allows convenient options for payload mounting."
msgstr "多样的机型形态为载荷安装提供了便利的选择。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:137 0727caae05164fbf8bf921013d9f86a6
msgid ":ref:`Helicopters <traditional-helicopters>`:"
msgstr ":ref:`直升机 <traditional-helicopters>`："

#: ../../source/index.rst:139 cedddec904c9418e821861063101a192
msgid "Typically use a single lifting rotor with two or more blades"
msgstr "通常使用一只带两片或更多桨叶的主旋翼提供升力"

#: ../../source/index.rst:140 df4147a85d97450787d406a078fdc9e7
msgid ""
"Maintain directional control by varying blade pitch via servo-actuated "
"mechanical linkage (many versions of these craft exist and it is beyond the "
"scope of this manual to cover them all -- the mechanical systems used in "
"helicopters warrant special study and consideration)"
msgstr "通过舵机驱动的机械连杆改变桨距来维持方向控制（这类机型版本众多，本手册无法逐一覆盖——直升机使用的机械系统需要专门学习与研究）"

#: ../../source/index.rst:145 e0e3df5f82ec4de7a4cf2fb35550a100
msgid ""
"Strong, fast and efficient -- a proven-worker suitable to many missions."
msgstr "强劲、快速、高效——经过实战检验、适用于多种任务的可靠机型。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:149 cf62207e70134faa8eff856cd7e8c180
msgid ""
"Because of its open design, Copter also supports more unusual frame types "
"including the :ref:`Single and Coax-Copters <singlecopter-and-coaxcopter>`."
"  Put this together with `Plane <https://ardupilot.org/plane/index.html>`__,"
" :ref:`Rover <rover:home>` and :ref:`Antenna Tracker <antennatracker:home>` "
"and you have a system of robotic vehicles that can be controlled through "
"very similar interfaces to accomplish a wide variety of tasks."
msgstr ""
"由于设计开放，Copter 还支持一些较为特殊的机型，包括 :ref:`单旋翼与共轴旋翼机 <singlecopter-and-"
"coaxcopter>`。再加上 `Plane "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/index.html>`__、:ref:`Rover <rover:home>` 与 "
":ref:`Antenna Tracker "
"<antennatracker:home>`，你就拥有了一套可以通过非常相似的界面操控的机器人载具系统，能够完成多种多样的任务。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:163 8bce990fec334f8baaf37a5fee052516
msgid "Getting more info"
msgstr "获取更多信息"

